{"name": "Souls Divided", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey Into the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Souls Divided</i></strong> is a puzzle game about perception, duality, and control. You play as a Dreamer who enters the astral realm of Namuru, a mysterious world shaped by two opposing forces: Order and Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To progress, you must split your soul and control multiple forms at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/6f18f1d2cf9ba0d204b8ee650ad22a88.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/6f18f1d2cf9ba0d204b8ee650ad22a88.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/6f18f1d2cf9ba0d204b8ee650ad22a88.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One body. Two souls. Three realms.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a physical body anchored to two ethereal forms, one aligned with Order, the other with Chaos. Each form experiences the world differently:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforms may exist in one realm but not the other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paths shift depending on your perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obstacles can disappear or appear when you switch forms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/4aaf71727263406315982bfa9f4c8fe0.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/4aaf71727263406315982bfa9f4c8fe0.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/4aaf71727263406315982bfa9f4c8fe0.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering these overlapping realities is the key to solving each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle systems that evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, new mechanics are introduced and combined in increasingly complex ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Observers</strong>:\u00a0Being seen forces your astral form back. Use line-of-sight to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/2c6b3737f2bec075937d4b4847fd9edc.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/2c6b3737f2bec075937d4b4847fd9edc.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/2c6b3737f2bec075937d4b4847fd9edc.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astral Platforms</strong>: Some objects on the realms interact with this platforms to open new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/1b0a8c5c78d565e48d21a8eb892bb381.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/1b0a8c5c78d565e48d21a8eb892bb381.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/1b0a8c5c78d565e48d21a8eb892bb381.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astral Mirrors</strong>: A linked mirror pair that extend your gaze to another space. Anything seen through the mirrors change their state.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/54fc90c10d5683eda1be9a34427b1c67.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/54fc90c10d5683eda1be9a34427b1c67.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/54fc90c10d5683eda1be9a34427b1c67.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Floating Crystals</strong>: Tools that change the state of objects can activate or deactivate this crystals. Change their state to control platforms, shift obstacles,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/16c7ef8c4279e117cca12994c4a844a8.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/16c7ef8c4279e117cca12994c4a844a8.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/16c7ef8c4279e117cca12994c4a844a8.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual Wormholes</strong>:\u00a0Push and pull objects across space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/83ad9dd62151754d0fd9871d5fcc4588.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/83ad9dd62151754d0fd9871d5fcc4588.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/83ad9dd62151754d0fd9871d5fcc4588.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limbo Dome</strong>:\u00a0Shift objects between realms to solve layered puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/7b7d7f6c6495f0c86f318b6f422f5e3e.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/7b7d7f6c6495f0c86f318b6f422f5e3e.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/7b7d7f6c6495f0c86f318b6f422f5e3e.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more... Each mechanic builds on the last, creating deeper and more challenging interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your tether is not a leash, it is a tool</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your forms are connected by a tether not just as a limitation, but as a core mechanic:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass the tether through objects to activate or alter them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger mechanisms, open paths, and break barriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage its position carefully some things sever the tether on contact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/90b6d23eb8e83bcbbe20298183377ee9.poster.avif?t=1782730101\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/90b6d23eb8e83bcbbe20298183377ee9.webm?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/extras/90b6d23eb8e83bcbbe20298183377ee9.mp4?t=1782730101\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Understanding how to use the tether creatively is essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles across <strong>three overlapping realms</strong>;\u00a0Physical, Order, and Chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control multiple forms with <strong>unique perspectives of the same space</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a <strong>tether-based interaction system</strong> to manipulate the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with <strong>observation-based mechanics</strong> where being seen has consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience <strong>progressively complex puzzles</strong> that reward logic and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a subtle, mysterious world inspired by original cosmology drawing from Gnostic philosophy and Zoroastrian dualism not good vs. evil, but the tension between structure and change</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A single-player puzzle game where you divide your soul into two forms, each perceiving a different dimension. Switch between them, manipulate ancient instruments, and solve layered puzzles across overlapping realities in a mysterious astral world left behind by a failed civilization.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617510/2834ce18b82711ee090115bf3eb7533f50f49663/header.jpg?t=1782730101", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "Stylized", "Fantasy", "Mythology", "Short"], "developers": "Stormdeep INC.", "publishers": "Stormdeep INC.", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4617510", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/8Sw_fSxAeJs", "first_seen": 1779487200.0, "review_rank": 609}